[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Find in MOCHI archives
Name[th]=ค้นหาในไฟล์บีบอัด MOCHI
Name[zh_CN]=在 MOCHI 压缩文件中查找
Comment=Search the file names inside every MOCHI archive in the chosen folders
Comment[th]=ค้นหาชื่อไฟล์ภายในไฟล์บีบอัด MOCHI ทุกไฟล์ในโฟลเดอร์ที่เลือก
Comment[zh_CN]=在所选文件夹中的每个 MOCHI 压缩文件里查找文件名
Keywords=MOCHI;archive;search;find;
Categories=Utility;
# MOCHI Find (the "Find in MOCHI archives" window): `--find` takes the folders to scan
# (none: the window opens and asks). A file manager passes the selected folders as %F.
# Registering inode/directory is what lists this under "Open With" for a folder; it never
# sets a default (the package ships no defaults list: smoke-deb.sh), and the system's own
# folder handler (the file manager) stays in charge. KDE's Dolphin and Cinnamon's Nemo get
# a real right-click entry from mochi-find-servicemenu.desktop and mochi-find.nemo_action.
Exec=mochi-desktop --find -- %F
Icon=mochi-desktop
StartupWMClass=mochi-desktop
Terminal=false
MimeType=inode/directory;
